{
  "title": "HR Platform",
  "uid": "hr-platform",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": ["hr-platform", "staging"],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Latence /api/leaves (p95/p50)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\", uri=~\"/api/leaves.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\", uri=~\"/api/leaves.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Latence /api/employees (p95/p50)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\", uri=~\"/api/employees.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\", uri=~\"/api/employees.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Taux d'erreurs HTTP 5xx (hr-backend)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "erreurs 5xx / total"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Replicas hr-backend (réel vs HPA min/max)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\"}",
          "legendFormat": "replicas actuels"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_spec_min_replicas{horizontalpodautoscaler=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\"}",
          "legendFormat": "HPA min"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_spec_max_replicas{horizontalpodautoscaler=\"hr-backend\", namespace=\"staging\"}",
          "legendFormat": "HPA max"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Connexions actives CNPG — indisponible",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Pas de données ici pour l'instant.** `apps/children/cnpg-cluster-staging.yaml` a `cluster.monitoring.enabled: false` — l'exporter Postgres de CNPG (qui exposerait `cnpg_backends_total`/`cnpg_pg_stat_activity_count` ou équivalent) n'est pas activé. Activer ce panneau nécessite de repasser cette valeur à `true` dans `cnpg-cluster-staging.yaml`, un changement volontairement laissé hors périmètre de cette tâche (voir guide-observabilite.md)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
